***REMOVED*** ═══════════════════════════════════════════
***REMOVED*** KONGGER API — Environment Configuration
***REMOVED*** ═══════════════════════════════════════════
***REMOVED*** Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
***REMOVED*** All values are read at startup via dotenv.
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED*** This is a SELLABLE PRODUCT — all configurable
***REMOVED*** values are listed here for white-label / rebrand.

***REMOVED*** ── PostgreSQL ───────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Required. Format: postgresql://REDACTED:REDACTED@host:port/database
***REMOVED*** For production, use a strong, unique password.
PG_CONNECTION_STRING= REDACTED

***REMOVED*** ── Authentication ───────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Required. At least 32 characters. Change for each deployment.
JWT_SECRET=change_this_to_a_random_64_char_string_minimum

***REMOVED*** ── Server ───────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** The port the API server listens on.
PORT=3001

***REMOVED*** ── CORS ─────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Allowed origins for CORS. Comma-separated for multiple.
***REMOVED*** In development: *
***REMOVED*** In production: https://your-frontend-domain.com
ALLOWED_ORIGIN=*

***REMOVED*** ── Rate Limiting ────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Max requests per minute (read vs write)
***REMOVED*** RATE_LIMIT_READ=120
***REMOVED*** RATE_LIMIT_WRITE=30
